OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment accused of 'defunding'
OL,4,AEast Midlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe planned cancellation of two major
OL,7,Froad schemes appears to be part of a
OL,8,Fstrategy to "defund" the East Midlands,
OL,9,Fthe region's local authorities have
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FThe claim features in a highly critical
OL,13,Fresponse to the government consultation
OL,14,Fon the scrapping of upgrades to the A38
OL,15,Fin Derbyshire and A46 in
OL,16,FNottinghamshire.
OL,18,FIn June, former prime minister Keir
OL,19,FStarmer said some transport projects
OL,20,Fwould be abandoned to help fund more
OL,21,Fdefence spending.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
