OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment accused of 'defunding'
OL,4,AEast Midlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the only two projects announced
OL,7,Fwere both in the East Midlands,
OL,8,Fprompting anger from local politicians,
OL,9,Fincluding Labour's regional mayor
OL,10,FClaire Ward.
